    <item>
      <title>voz 0.0.5-beta.100026</title>
      <description>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Extensions that miss their deadline can no longer change your text&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ask once for a GitHub star after you dictate 2,000 words&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Show small Top apps bars as rounded bars&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dragging a TypeScript file no longer opens the audio drop zone&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Drop a file on the floating indicator to transcribe it, with a clearer drop target&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Learn dictionary words from spelled-out names and spoken corrections&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fix words Voz keeps mishearing with rules like voss → Voz&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Show long notifications in full&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Run extension actions from buttons at the bottom of the panel&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Browse and manage extensions from a simpler list with a page per extension&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Find, add and accept dictionary words from one field&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Drop an audio or video file on the notch to transcribe it with an extension&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Copy a Claude Code prompt from the Extensions page to build your own extension&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Show each installed package&amp;#x27;s description in the Extensions page&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bring back the Voz face in the menu bar icon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Show the menu bar icon in white on dark menu bars&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
      <link>https://github.com/Joelheile/voz/releases/tag/beta-100026</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:10:46 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>100026</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.5-beta.100026</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Joelheile/voz/releases/download/beta-100026/voz-0.0.5-beta.100026.zip" length="8400554" sparkle:edSignature="vea8qIa2QRwsMfRoOMBmTkJ/GQBEN1IDh9CrHIHkUhPbEtJq7eXQ7+8ZRqaib87ukPRy5ERfkdRIp5nisJB4CA==" type="application/octet-stream" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>voz 0.0.5</title>
      <description>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Copy, paste, select all and undo work in the Voz panel&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A tile next to System Settings lets you drag Voz into Accessibility and Input Monitoring&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adding the voz command asks for your password instead of showing a Terminal command&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Voz tells you when its menu bar icon is hidden behind the notch&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Paste one prompt into a coding agent to build an extension with it&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Simplify the extension API: read settings with voz.settings, log with console.log, and return { text: &amp;quot;&amp;quot; } to insert nothing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;See your top apps, with their icons, in Insights&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Updates install only while your Mac is idle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Setup runs again after a fresh install&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;See the time left while a speech model downloads&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Calmer settings and a red dot while you record&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Smoother transcript navigation and consistent menu icons&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Moving Voz to the Trash quits it and removes its login item&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Slow extensions and cleanup can no longer stall dictation or startup&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Voz tells you when microphone access is denied&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The app includes the licenses of its dependencies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
      <link>https://github.com/Joelheile/voz/releases/tag/v0.0.5</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:02:57 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>100010</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Joelheile/voz/releases/download/v0.0.5/voz-0.0.5.zip" length="8233134" sparkle:edSignature="eOjR6TqRMq+Zj3wywu8gKobSlU7r/SRhZrDgyg8NvU4b5ysIJy+HHtlKqf6MugQIgIkCh++r043VZK3tcN7MDA==" type="application/octet-stream" />
    </item>
